title: "Certified Spectral Computation for Semilinear Evolution: Finite Records and Polynomial Bit Cost"
type: article
authors:
  - family-names: Guo
    given-names: Jinku
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-6600-6171"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23582642"
